# Spec 06 — build-context trim for the Dockerfiles.
# The Dockerfiles build from the repo root (context: .); this file keeps the
# context small (no .git / bin / obj / tests) so the daemon transfer is fast and
# deterministic. Deploy artifacts only — nothing here affects runtime config.

**/bin
**/obj
.git
.vs
.claude
tests
docs
evals
.vs
**/*.user
**/*.suo
.env
.env.*
*.log
